    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n82127" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περισκῠθ-ίζω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>scalp in Scythian fashion</i>, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				2
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>Ma.</u>
				7.4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Phalar.
				<u>Ep.</u>
				147.3
			</span></i> (
				Pass.
			). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> as a
			surgical operation, <i><span class="en">
