				<u>PMed.</u> in <i><span class="en">
				<u>Arch.Pap.</u>
				4.270
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii A. D.)</span> ; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περισκυφίζω</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> sens. obsc., <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				12.95.6
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Mel.
			</span></i>).</div>
